abstract: >
  Reproducibility package for the LTCM (Long-Term Construction Memory) framework
  for SHM-integrated Digital Twins. Includes OWL/Turtle ontology, system configuration,
  PINN training scripts, SPARQL query examples, MARG prompt template, and 40
  representative benchmark queries (Supplementary S1).
keywords:
  - structural health monitoring
  - digital twin
  - lifecycle memory
  - physics-informed neural networks
  - knowledge graph
  - retrieval-augmented generation
